B.aHe=new A.d8("quant-watchlists","Quant Watchlists (Lab)","Quant Watchlists (Lab)",B.m2,!1,!1,B.hb,null,B.agu,B.agO,!1,"INTERNO: watchlists persistentes com identidade can\xf4nica de instrumento, RLS por dono e predicado de entitlement no banco (admin-only enquanto INTERNAL). Separado de quant-analytics por gravar estado (REVERSIBLE).","INTERNAL: persistent watchlists with canonical instrument identity, owner RLS and a database entitlement predicate (admin-only while INTERNAL). Split from quant-analytics because it writes state (REVERSIBLE).","REVERSIBLE (servidor: module_policy.ts; Codex CXA-02). Promover al\xe9m de INTERNAL exige nova migration do predicado SQL (teste QB-16).",null)
